CHAPTER.VERS:
And this is love, that we should walk after his commandments. This is the commandment, even as you

          {+}
         heard from the beginning, that you

          {+}
         should walk in it.

Look to yourselves, that you

          {+}
         don't lose the things which we have worked for, but that you

          {+}
         receive a full reward.

If anyone comes to you

          {+}
        , and doesn't bring this teaching, don't receive him into [your

          {+}
        ] house, and give him no greeting:

Having many things to write to you

          {+}
        , I would not [write them] with paper and ink: but I hope to come to you

          {+}
        , and to speak face to face, that our joy may be made full.
